          </div>

          <h1 class="mfg-hero__title">
            Intelligent Software for <br />
            <span class="text-gradient">Manufacturing ERP</span> &amp; Smart Factories
          </h1>

          <p class="mfg-hero__lead">
            Eliminate production bottlenecks, material shortages, and disconnected shop floor spreadsheets. Unify production scheduling, multi-level BOMs, real-time MRP, machine OEE tracking, quality control, and factory ERP into one intelligent operating system.
          </p>

          <div class="mfg-hero__tags">
            <div class="tag-item">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0bbf8a" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>Multi-Level BOM &amp; MRP</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tag-item">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0bbf8a" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>Real-Time Shop Floor OEE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tag-item">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0bbf8a" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>Batch &amp; Lot Traceability</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tag-item">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0bbf8a" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>Quality Control &amp; CMMS</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mfg-hero__actions">
            <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn-primary">
