                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="pipeline-column">
                        <span class="pipe-head">In Progress (24)</span>
                        <div class="pipe-item active">
                          <strong>WO-8912 &bull; Gear Box</strong>
                          <span>CNC Cell 04 &bull; 120 Units</span>
                          <span class="pipe-badge green">Cycle: 92%</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pipe-item">
                          <strong>WO-8908 &bull; Electric Motor</strong>
                          <span>Assembly Bay 02 &bull; 80 Units</span>
                          <span class="pipe-badge hot">Priority 1</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="pipeline-column">
                        <span class="pipe-head">QC Inspection (8)</span>
                        <div class="pipe-item">
                          <strong>WO-8899 &bull; Shaft Rotor</strong>
                          <span>Batch #Q-4019 &bull; 300 Units</span>
                          <span class="pipe-badge green">Tolerance OK</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab 2: Multi-Level BOM -->
            <div class="hub-panel" id="tab-bom">
              <div class="panel-split">
                <div class="panel-info">
                  <span class="panel-badge">Product Structure &amp; Engineering</span>
                  <h3>Hierarchical BOM Tree &amp; Engineering Change Orders (ECO)</h3>
                  <p>Manage complex product structures with unlimited nested sub-assemblies, scrap percentage allowances, component substitutions, and revision control with digital approval trails.</p>
                  <ul class="panel-checklist">
                    <li><strong>Version-Controlled BOMs:</strong> Full ECO workflows with digital sign-offs, change history, and effectivity dates.</li>
                    <li><strong>Routing &amp; Work Centers:</strong> Standard operating times (setup, run, cleanup) mapped to specific machinery and labor rates.</li>
                    <li><strong>Live Cost Rollup Engine:</strong> Real-time material, labor, and machine overhead cost calculation per finished SKU.</li>
                  </ul>
                  <a href="/contact-us/" class="panel-cta-btn">View BOM Management Tools →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="panel-mockup">
                  <div class="mockup-card">
                    <div class="mockup-top">
                      <strong>Multi-Level BOM Explorer &bull; SKU #ASM-408</strong>
                      <span class="mockup-pill green">ECO V3.4 Active</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bom-tree-preview">
                      <div class="bom-node root">
                        <div class="bom-icon">
                          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0b55d9" stroke-width="2.5"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bom-info">
                          <strong>ASM-408: High-Pressure Hydraulic Pump</strong>
                          <span>1 Unit &bull; Total Unit Cost: ₹4,820 &bull; Ready</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="table-pill green">Released</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="bom-subnodes">
                        <div class="bom-node child">
                          <span class="tree-line">↳</span>
                          <div class="bom-info">
                            <strong>SUB-102: Rotor &amp; Drive Shaft Assembly</strong>
                            <span>Qty: 1 &bull; CNC Lathe Cell &bull; Cost: ₹1,850</span>
                          </div>
                          <span class="table-pill blue">Sub-Assembly</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bom-node child indent">
                          <span class="tree-line">↳</span>
                          <div class="bom-info">
                            <strong>RAW-304: Forged Alloy Steel Bar (AISI 4140)</strong>
                            <span>Qty: 2.4 kg &bull; Bin: RM-04 &bull; Cost: ₹720</span>
                          </div>
